{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：20:30 2026-11-22 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"陳煒53歲生日落區快閃打卡  鐵粉包旺角銅鑼灣大屏幕賀壽兼唱生日歌  煒哥坦言：尷尬但感動\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/671d623ee5d34f529c8a7983638d77a8/2026-11/Copy_of_KF__117.png\"/>\n<p>陳煒昨日迎來53歲生日，一眾忠實粉絲為了給偶像送上難忘驚喜，包下銅鑼灣、尖沙咀及旺角等核心地標的大型LED大屏幕「賣廣告」霸氣賀壽。在大屏幕上滾動播放著煒哥入行三十載的經典角色與絕美靚相，並寫上「宇宙盡頭，有你就夠」向偶像深情告白。而向來寵粉的陳煒亦相當識做，特別抽空親身現身各區「快閃」打卡，答謝粉絲支持。她每到一處都引來大批影迷圍觀，更有途人興奮大唱生日歌，現場氣氛極為高漲，逗得陳煒笑逐顏開。</p>\n<h2>陳煒落區打卡與粉絲見面</h2>\n<p>陳煒隨後在社交平台貼出打卡照並感性發文，毫無保留地向粉絲表達愛意。陳煒發文表示：「昨天絕對是人生中一次難忘嘅生日，感謝粉絲破費投了旺角、尖沙咀、銅鑼灣三個大屏幕為我祝壽，fans們大大聲在鬧市唱生日歌，搞到我很尷尬，但亦好感動，更加要感謝專誠從馬來西亞、杭州、上海等地的粉絲飛來同我一起快閃打卡過生日，還有感謝各位朋友給我的祝福，全部收到晒，I love you all」，字裡行間充滿了對海內外粉絲專程飛來支持的感動。</p>\n<img alt=\"陳煒樣貌身材都保養得宜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d8543c863f6b1fab5c636339a3259626/2024-09/318656108_540831224337719_8402931693705212337_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒早前於《夫妻肺片》大爆曾被同劇男星追求。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/11992ebd842004b6699ad39ccc9a2c26/2026-06/3_11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒指對方於言語上不斷撩她，網民紛紛猜測陳煒所指追求她的藝人是王梓軒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3eac9072184cec286edfa60fd61aa044/2026-06/4_15_7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"粉絲為陳煒包下地標的大屏幕賀壽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e456a2a2be97ae2692174f1e9927d0aa/2026-11/SaveClip_App_915549240_18094587203706684_1702921306540646669_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒坦言對於粉絲的舉動好感動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f9c543502196e25a367dca1add1591ac/2026-11/SaveClip_App_918544977_18094587212706684_8848929088857274153_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"驚喜現身支持的胡慧中女兒何嘉珍（左）與偶像陳煒（右）親密貼頭合照，追星成功留下無比溫馨的瞬間。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e7c395987cf8303cda43ddedac5f7e41/2026-11/SaveClip_App_925127190_18094587155706684_8016296885266152323_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒單手舉起球拍散發陽光氣息，零死角美貌獲網民激讚凍齡有術。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/684e197100681b3447b78e01a8f116c4/2026-09/SaveClip_App_824564271_18634899064038930_2119851939048409753_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒去年成為TVB台慶大贏家。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a277a7062be3ce2c052c9756b4d0240/2025-12/alicechanwai_1763610121_3769757386966419656_1743590929.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒憑《巨塔之后》獲提名《萬千星輝頒獎典禮2025》的「最佳女主角」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ea4b64a71c65ab94a5d3252db635fafb/2025-12/alicechanwai_1756114892_3706882847912677745_1743590929.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒因拍攝《巨塔之后》與宣萱成為好友。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2130470148b5f44048220cc1b0f08b0f/2025-12/alicechanwai_1761405210_3751261254112060516_1743590929.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒早前於IG上載和陳國強的甜蜜合照，賀老公新醫美中心開業。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6ed15f01e3638099aeb2c1013db623f5/2026-05/177825010654541.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒於《正義女神》中演出極佳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/693d15778e4b3f083b1c9ff32561f9e1/2026-05/YYY.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒兩年前就曾盛裝賀老公陳國強的醫美中心開幕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4a4495eb5805df3f776bc24429461c5b/2024-03/011_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒有「索爆人妻」的美譽！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/484e2c9b8e6f2b82a215077805459fa9/2024-03/016_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒近年找到第二春。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/01ddc2ea85118b7798f37db17e342619/2022-09/12_60.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒2022年拍攝的婚紗照好性感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b929082d36db163517a81c3aa23ea4df/2022-09/5_152.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒與醫生老公陳國強於2022年結婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b011bf740bb3f8c28e88cb68a00e7fda/2023-05/alice_aldous07.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒多年來都凍齡有術，狀態越戰越勇。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/93d0e913ff98ab485ade6dc6244a09e5/2024-02/403199096_18402396670038930_458101783836072567_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒50歲生日後，成為TVB最索的五十路人妻。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/faa4804656003fdf6324657a4324d74e/2023-04/img_2382.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒再婚後不時放閃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6365bbe8243661608881bdec6b7dc5da/2024-09/461406235_18463984291038930_9098397254783840650_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒每年結婚周年都收到老公陳國強的禮物。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b9f978b8ebc3a3bccd538c9f70f49888/2024-09/461513896_18463984303038930_539712496525717767_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"其中一張抱著兩隻愛貓的「一家四口」合照，幸福氛圍羨煞旁人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a920af3ee1398ffd29f083814148058/2025-12/1__.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒也安排了多場生日派對。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e070da087a9aa050d549aabf8b0809b6/2025-12/2_49.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒夫婦與多位朋友聚餐，氣氛熱鬧。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/18e3e0fb3d44745e9286f217a471476c/2025-12/3_56.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒早前與陳曉華、關楓馨及何沛珈拍旅遊節目！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a857d0d209db9353c7485ed715b65a18/2024-06/04_3_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"對三個20多歲的新晉小花，半百的陳煒一點都未有被比下去。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b076fa201cd2ebcf272a373f23c44574/2024-06/26_11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"半百陳煒絲毫未見有老態！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5faf6625f5321c772472481b3efd3171/2024-06/28_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒與陳曉華穿上漢服打卡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/728e4519b1845c42ab9916f69832454d/2024-06/31_6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒與陳曉華穿上漢服打卡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f8614569d06d61725b74edd525a2b7c6/2024-06/32_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"身形FIT爆的陳煒晒驚人上圍！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4b8c0d405475e61648405988b9b1ccbf/2024-06/37_6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒皮膚緊緻白滑，身上零贅肉！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e22b82e86e43d637d088753c630c563f/2024-06/40_6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒一對白滑長腿相當養眼！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/de73f6fa015a396152d88757fcef5612/2024-06/42_0_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒曾經是亞視當家花旦。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/593142f73919bff169e12966da7d9760/2023-04/enp16p10270903.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"當時陳煒造型百變。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/fa1deffbc9f71f77122cc9f965c90ec7/2023-04/img_6421_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒當年已經好性感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8c6165c3b336ba53450e2b781b18b287/2023-04/dcent13306082002.jpg\"/>\n<h2>胡慧中女兒亦是陳煒粉絲</h2>\n<p>在現場曝光的合照中，更驚現一位「星二代」的身影，原來息影女星胡慧中的獨生女何嘉珍亦是陳煒的忠實支持者，當天她專程現身銅鑼灣支持偶像，並與陳煒親密貼頭合照，追星成功。事後何嘉珍在社交平台分享了這份喜悅，她發文寫道：「每一刻都是小永遠，人類比星星數量要稀少，從宇宙的角度來說，你比星星更特別，希望你快樂不止生日，是今天、明天、天天。雖然已經講過很多次，但是也要說：煒哥，生日快樂」這番浪漫又真摯的生日祝福，完美展現了她對偶像滿滿的愛。</p>\n<img alt=\"陳煒的愛巢樓底睇落都好高！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6050e5d7a2c28e1f0c73b4a6631ab126/2023-02/alicechanwai_330410819_9003170576420570_4544041873704811853_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"客廳相當巨大！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a37a59357679e1e60b3c75f6f72d7c1b/2023-02/rebecca_zhu_330645319_724674729144016_667133852412443619_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"簡潔而溫馨！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d8ec247f94d1bc565bbfde9bf3448bd3/2023-02/rebecca_zhu_331049534_139391882348463_3794742606399456495_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒1996年選亞姐入行，當年陳煒一頭短髮好清爽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/24c5e2d59c259740dd0cb0195d21b15a/2023-04/missasia_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒當年大熱奪冠。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f19fad8899bb868bafed07684d7363f8/2023-04/missasia_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒當年大熱奪冠。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4bb9b90fa741c658ec1a408e5687bb08/2023-04/missasia_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒出道初是曾經是短髮look。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a023c1e67ea64154c92fd19f6298ae2f/2023-04/3_1_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒過檔TVB後，不介意性感演出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3645262a168d7d84fad866e8bb47e22d/2022-09/2012%282%29.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"2012年《法網狙擊》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2a54c1583f7d888d2a7e243093e76839/2022-09/2012.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒不時派福利。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8197ad613b7da9caa7307f68cb25c393/2023-09/alice_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒的泳裝性感度爆燈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fd0b3b6e6a09c5c5987975a593cc59dc/2023-09/alice_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒的泳照好吸睛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e92bb9a4d4d19bd7203eb093f9d67f4c/2023-09/alice_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"近年陳煒都以長髮示人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9f3ae7be510e63c806d4cd64b367de98/2023-04/330410819_9003170576420570_4544041873704811853_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒凍齡有術，完全看不出已經「入五」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d8b9603581ce9a5f4c7344e9d2e879ae/2023-04/209051142_491014198633605_6319116403771802953_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒大晒曲線。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9a4a972dbec3703e1add403747a6e797/2023-09/alice_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒曾分享靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ba75770ce1af29a9fda373634e23cebe/2023-09/alice_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒之前的泳照未夠Fit。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8f48ed83ff5c87d76fc02207fcf74e01/2023-09/alice_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒的出海相好靚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a3b5a1834aec30612b91b214cfd9176d/2023-09/alice_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒的福利圖。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/34e4753e3fb170149a5370af1341d024/2023-09/alice_14_.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T12:43:49.872525+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":676,"images":55,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T12:30:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T18:57:49.204095+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T12:37:25.603427+00:00","content_hash":"9af4125b47e7fe4c35b1a6d94365befa18bcf450b1459421e1c8a100c7faea90","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}